{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>And now, etc.</b> Meaning: at that very hour, he should hurry to bring from the ready-prepared kids of the goats." "<b>Listen to my voice.</b> Meaning: even though these matters involve stealing the mind (deception), with all that, you must listen to my voice. Meaning: aside from the obligation of the commandment to honor father and mother, which is a positive commandment, she is also a prophetess, and it is written regarding the words of a true prophet (Deuteronomy 18:15): ״אֵלָיו תִּשְׁמָעוּן״. Therefore she said, <b>Listen to my voice</b> — and we have already written (Genesis 16:5) that a prophet may be justified in saying to transgress a commandment of the Torah for the time being:"], :book :genesis, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 27, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:43:45.004387978Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}